    narr:narration """This hub documents the formalization of a deployment gate for Meridian artifacts, requiring a signed release manifest as a prerequisite for shipping. The requirement is presented as a [mandatory policy instruction](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) and is further codified through [formal decision outcomes](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) that define the [operational scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) as encompassing both staging and production environments. The rationale for this gate is grounded in a [past failure event](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), where the presence of unsigned artifacts in staging necessitated a corrective control. The accountability for this gate is [explicitly assigned](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5), framing the requirement not merely as a technical standard but as a managed responsibility.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The gate is framed as a reactive correction to a specific past incident rather than a proactive architectural standard." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Ownership is explicitly claimed as a decision outcome, linking the policy to an individual actor rather than a systemic process." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
